{"id":1040602,"chapter_id":1040602,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"你在珀尔夫人的带领下穿过剧场内复杂的走廊，无数似曾相识的布景在你面前闪过。","style":3,"background":2174,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"珀尔夫人","content":"不出意外的话，这本该是明年上演的剧目，也是福尔图娜规模最大的一部戏。","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_2"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":2174,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"speaker":"珀尔夫人","content":"只可惜时间不够，剧本也只写了一半。","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_3"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":2174,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"content":"“帐篷已经倒塌，所有人遗忘了原本的家。\n\n“我们要去寻找遥远的城堡，沿着那条小路便可到达。\n\n“那里可以忘记一切挣扎，人们会拉着你一起跳舞啊。”","style":14,"background":2174,"is_centered":true,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"content":"“盛大的舞啊，忘记一切挣扎！\n\n“所有人都来跳这支舞啊，直到幸福愈合所有伤疤！\n\n“时间不会停留在某一刹那，\n\n“一直跳着盛大的舞啊！”","style":14,"background":2174,"is_centered":true,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"options":["我看过这段歌词"],"style":6,"background":2174,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602006,"trial_step":6,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"我看过这段歌词","goto":7}]},{"step":7,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"这段歌词写在艾可的稿纸后面……是你写的？","style":2,"background":2174,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"content":"珀尔笑着默认了你的问题。你们迅速穿过长廊，向尽头的某扇门去。","style":3,"background":2174,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"speaker":"珀尔夫人","content":"这里是福尔图娜，我们在欢庆与歌舞中“选择”自己最渴望的人生……","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":2174,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"speaker":"珀尔夫人","content":"但仅仅是这样不会太过无趣吗？","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":2174,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"content":"珀尔夫人停在门前，转身看向你。","style":3,"background":2174,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"speaker":"珀尔夫人","content":"平顺的故事毫无新意，落魄后的挣扎与抗争才足以振奋人心——","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":2174,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"speaker":"珀尔夫人","content":"这是关于福尔图娜的歌，接下来也是关于福尔图娜的故事。","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":2174,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"speaker":"珀尔夫人","content":"“在前往城堡的小路上，四人踏着欢闹的步伐。”","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":2174,"is_centered":true,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"speaker":"珀尔夫人","content":"“一人不看脚下，从高处踏空；一人纵情歌舞，却被身上华服拖住脚步；”","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":2174,"is_centered":true,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"speaker":"珀尔夫人","content":"“一人去捡地上硬币，却被游行撞倒；一人为了跟上舞蹈，不惜交出珍宝。”","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":2174,"is_centered":true,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"speaker":"珀尔夫人","content":"“但这支舞仍会继续，这支舞永不终结。”","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_17"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":2174,"is_centered":true,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"content":"她向你眨眨眼，紧接着推开面前的房门。","style":3,"background":2174,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"speaker":"珀尔夫人","content":"来吧，不要害怕——","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":2174,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"speaker":"珀尔夫人","content":"请在表演中尽情探索，找出这里的真相吧。","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":2174,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602020,"trial_step":20},{"step":21,"content":"<size=45>——第一幕· 过去——</size>","style":14,"background":10000,"is_centered":true,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602022,"trial_step":22},{"step":22,"content":"<color=#7683a2><i>男人是个不出名的剧团团长，他有才华、有同伴，但这些并未给他带来财富。仅靠那不入流的表演，收入根本无法养起剧团。</i></color>","style":3,"background":2171,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602023,"trial_step":23},{"step":23,"content":"<color=#7683a2><i>但好在，他的才华也为他带来了另一样东西——某位投资人的青睐。投资人每月固定来看一场戏，并在散场后留下一笔钱财。就这样，剧团得以继续经营下去。</i></color>","style":3,"background":2171,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602024,"trial_step":24},{"step":24,"speaker":"珀尔夫人","content":"但某日，走上正轨的剧团再次陷入危机……","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":2171,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602025,"trial_step":25},{"step":25,"content":"<color=#7683a2><i>那是月度演出的第二日。剧团长坐在华丽的办公室中，他被无数价值不菲的奢侈品包围——却显得坐立难安。</i></color>","style":3,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602026,"trial_step":26},{"step":26,"content":"<color=#7683a2><i>他焦头烂额地翻动着眼前的保险柜，房间中只能听见他的咒骂与翻找物品的声响。</i></color>","style":3,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602027,"trial_step":27},{"step":27,"content":"<color=#7683a2><i>“砰砰砰”，房门被用力敲响。男人僵了一下，缓慢起身抚平衣角后开口。</i></color>","style":3,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602028,"trial_step":28},{"step":28,"speaker":"剧团长","content":"……进来吧。","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_29"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602029,"trial_step":29},{"step":29,"content":"<color=#7683a2><i>房门打开，剧场的另外三位成员依次走进房间：热情市侩的售票员小哥、手艺高超的道具师先生，以及拥有美妙歌喉的演员小姐。</i></color>","style":3,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602030,"trial_step":30},{"step":30,"content":"<color=#7683a2><i>剧团长扫视着面前几位剧团功臣，沉重开口：</i></color>","style":3,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602031,"trial_step":31},{"step":31,"speaker":"剧团长","content":"我将几位叫过来，就是希望能够尽量隐蔽地解决这件事……","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_32"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602032,"trial_step":32},{"step":32,"speaker":"剧团长","content":"就在今天，有人撬开保险箱，偷走了投资人留下的所有钱财。","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_33"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602033,"trial_step":33},{"step":33,"speaker":"众人","content":"！！","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_34"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602034,"trial_step":34},{"step":34,"content":"<color=#7683a2><i>房间瞬间陷入安静，猜忌的眼神在众人间轮转，疑窦陡生。</i></color>","style":3,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602035,"trial_step":35},{"step":35,"speaker":"剧团长","content":"在今天上午的时段里，剧场中只有你们几位。我不愿猜忌……但窃贼肯定就在这个房间中！","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_36"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602036,"trial_step":36},{"step":36,"speaker":"剧团长","content":"这笔钱非常重要，没有它，剧团根本撑不过这个月。我们所有人都得走！","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602037,"trial_step":37},{"step":37,"speaker":"剧团长","content":"就算暂停今晚的演出，也必须找到这笔钱！","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_38"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602038,"trial_step":38},{"step":38,"content":"<color=#7683a2><i>房间再次陷入死寂，气氛陷入焦灼，没有人愿意第一个开口……</i></color>","style":3,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602039,"trial_step":39},{"step":39,"options":["等等"],"style":6,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602040,"trial_step":40,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"等等","goto":41}]},{"step":40,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"等下，我有个问题。","style":2,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602041,"trial_step":41},{"step":41,"content":"珀尔夫人和你正坐在办公室的另一套座椅上，旁观眼前的闹剧。","style":3,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602042,"trial_step":42},{"step":42,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"你……之前还当过福尔图娜的投资人？","style":2,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602043,"trial_step":43},{"step":43,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"我以为这个剧场是你直接买下的。","style":2,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602044,"trial_step":44},{"step":44,"speaker":"珀尔夫人","content":"别急着下定论，亲爱的。","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_45"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602045,"trial_step":45},{"step":45,"speaker":"珀尔夫人","content":"这可是一部“未完成”的剧本，故事由所有参演者的选择编织而成。","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_46"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602046,"trial_step":46},{"step":46,"content":"越过女人的帽檐，你可以看到珀尔夫人轻快的微笑。","style":3,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602047,"trial_step":47},{"step":47,"speaker":"珀尔夫人","content":"正是未知……才会更加有趣啊。","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_48"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602048,"trial_step":48},{"step":48,"speaker":"珀尔夫人","content":"换个更有意思的话题吧——你觉得，这几人里谁会是“罪人”呢？","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_49"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602049,"trial_step":49},{"step":49,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"这要看他们给出的不在场证明了。","style":2,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602050,"trial_step":50},{"step":50,"content":"<i><size=45>-第一位疑犯的自白-</size></i>","style":14,"background":1038,"is_centered":true,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602051,"trial_step":51},{"step":51,"speaker":"道具师先生","content":"今天我在舞台上对晚上演出的装置做维修检查。","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_52"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602052,"trial_step":52},{"step":52,"speaker":"道具师先生","content":"就算看不见我，舞台上的灯也会投出我的影子，所有参与排练的成员都能证明。","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_53"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602053,"trial_step":53},{"step":53,"content":"道具师轻描淡写地讲述自己的工作流程。他双手插兜歪斜着身子，似乎也并不在意眼前的疑案。","style":3,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602054,"trial_step":54},{"step":54,"speaker":"道具师先生","content":"整个下午我都没来过后台，更不可能偷钱了。","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_55"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602055,"trial_step":55},{"step":55,"content":"<i><size=45>-第二位疑犯的自白-</size></i>","style":14,"background":1038,"is_centered":true,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602056,"trial_step":56},{"step":56,"speaker":"演员小姐","content":"上午我一直在自己的化妆间里练声，整个后台都能听到歌声，他们都可以证明我的清白。","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_57"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602057,"trial_step":57},{"step":57,"speaker":"演员小姐","content":"而且跟那些跑龙套的小角色不一样，我不缺演出的分红，也不至于为了点小钱破坏原则。","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_58"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602058,"trial_step":58},{"step":58,"content":"演员小姐的语气中透着掩不住的傲气，似乎比起这件案子，她更关注自己胸前的挂坠是否足够亮眼。","style":3,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602059,"trial_step":59},{"step":59,"speaker":"演员小姐","content":"赶紧查完让我回去化妆，我的珠宝还没收拾好呢。","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_60"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602060,"trial_step":60},{"step":60,"content":"<i><size=45>-第三位疑犯的自白-</size></i>","style":14,"background":1038,"is_centered":true,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602061,"trial_step":61},{"step":61,"speaker":"售票员小哥","content":"我？团长你还不清楚我吗！","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_62"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602062,"trial_step":62},{"step":62,"speaker":"售票员小哥","content":"外面都看不上我辛迪加的出身，只有团长你肯收留我——有这份恩情在，我哪还能当叛徒啊！","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_63"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602063,"trial_step":63},{"step":63,"content":"售票员小哥信誓旦旦地拍着胸口，话语激昂且亢奋，势要证明自己清白。","style":3,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602064,"trial_step":64},{"step":64,"speaker":"售票员小哥","content":"下午那会儿我……哎，我确实在售票处偷了个懒，但那售票处甚至不在剧场里，何况进来偷东西啊！","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_65"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602065,"trial_step":65},{"step":65,"content":"<color=#7683a2><i>三位嫌疑人依次陈述着自己的立场，但态度截然不同：演员小姐皱紧眉头极不耐烦，道具师先生目光涣散沉默不语，售票员小哥脸上则挂着尴尬的笑容，眼神左右闪躲。</i></color>","style":3,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602066,"trial_step":66},{"step":66,"speaker":"演员小姐","content":"啧，要我说根本没必要这么大费周折。看看几个人里谁最缺钱不就明白了？","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_67"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602067,"trial_step":67},{"step":67,"speaker":"演员小姐","content":"嘴上攀着亲戚，结果还从人家口袋里偷钱——不愧是西区来的老鼠，手够脏的。","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_68"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602068,"trial_step":68},{"step":68,"speaker":"售票员小哥","content":"——你！","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_69"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602069,"trial_step":69},{"step":69,"content":"<color=#7683a2><i>矛头瞬间指向售票员，他愤怒地看向演员，一口咬回来。</i></color>","style":3,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602070,"trial_step":70},{"step":70,"speaker":"售票员小哥","content":"呵，那你也不是什么好果子！化妆间里的那么多皮草珠宝……奢侈品店的赊账不还得靠投资人来还？！","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_71"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602071,"trial_step":71},{"step":71,"speaker":"演员小姐","content":"什么？！等等……你偷看我的账单？！","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_72"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602072,"trial_step":72},{"step":72,"content":"<color=#7683a2><i>女人一巴掌扇向售票员。两人撕吵起来，混乱进一步升级。试图上前拉架的道具师也被卷入其中。</i></color>","style":3,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602073,"trial_step":73},{"step":73,"speaker":"演员小姐","content":"哈哈，装什么好人？！你不是也欠着债吗！","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_74"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602074,"trial_step":74},{"step":74,"speaker":"演员小姐","content":"“只不过偷懒少检查了一点儿，没想到吊钢丝的演员就这么摔下来了……”","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_75"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602075,"trial_step":75},{"step":75,"speaker":"演员小姐","content":"小姑娘还在病床上躺着呢吧？呵呵，该你赔的钱，怕是一分都出不起吧？","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_76"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602076,"trial_step":76},{"step":76,"content":"剧团成员们吵成一团，他们互相揭短，将所有人都拉下水。在言语混战间，你敏锐地抓出一处疑点——","style":3,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602077,"trial_step":77},{"step":77,"content":"这是一座优秀的剧院，但似乎没人挂心最重要的演出。所有人都在尽力撇清自己的嫌疑，在意金钱、在意利益——在意那位从未出场的<color=#fb9259>投资人</color>。","style":3,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602078,"trial_step":78},{"step":78,"content":"珀尔夫人饶有兴趣地观察这场闹剧。混乱中心的几人像是她的木偶，随着剧本踏上舞台，发生争吵，仅为满足观众的需要。","style":3,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602079,"trial_step":79},{"step":79,"speaker":"珀尔夫人","content":"肆意奢侈的人、犯错欠债的人、出身贫穷的人……","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_80"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602080,"trial_step":80},{"step":80,"speaker":"珀尔夫人","content":"你说，到底哪位才是真正的罪人呢？","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_81"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602081,"trial_step":81},{"step":81,"options":["故事还没听完"],"style":6,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602082,"trial_step":82,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"故事还没听完","goto":83}]},{"step":82,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"故事还没听完呢，还有最后一位疑犯的阐述。","style":2,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602083,"trial_step":83},{"step":83,"content":"像是按下暂停键，所有演员突然停住动作。你的视线穿过正在争吵的人群，投向房间正中——剧团长的座位。","style":3,"background":1038,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602084,"trial_step":84},{"step":84,"content":"<i><size=45>-最后一位疑犯的自白-</size></i>","style":14,"background":10000,"is_centered":true,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602085,"trial_step":85},{"step":85,"speaker":"剧团长","content":"我不是偷钱的“罪人”。","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_86"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":2173,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602086,"trial_step":86},{"step":86,"speaker":"剧团长","content":"……只是，这钱箱里早就没钱了。","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_87"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":2173,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602087,"trial_step":87},{"step":87,"content":"他如同被操控的木偶，平静又冰冷地开始讲述。","style":3,"background":2173,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602088,"trial_step":88},{"step":88,"speaker":"剧团长","content":"最开始是因为借不到钱，我赌了第一把，赚的钱让剧团又维持了半个月。然后是第二把、第三把……输一点没关系，只要再赢一把我就能把钱添上……","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_89"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":2173,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602089,"trial_step":89},{"step":89,"speaker":"剧团长","content":"但昨天我输了，血本无归。","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_90"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":2173,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602090,"trial_step":90},{"step":90,"speaker":"剧团长","content":"几百万的空缺，我能怎么填上？卖了我也还不上！","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_91"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":2173,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602091,"trial_step":91},{"step":91,"speaker":"剧团长","content":"除非……","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_92"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":2173,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602092,"trial_step":92},{"step":92,"speaker":"剧团长","content":"没错。只要让“某个人”偷走这笔钱就好了。","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_93"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":2173,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602093,"trial_step":93},{"step":93,"speaker":"剧团长","content":"投资人就不会深究，她会继续帮我们的，只要她不问缘由……我们就能继续这样幸福地生活……","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_94"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":2173,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602094,"trial_step":94},{"step":94,"speaker":"剧团长","content":"一切难题，都会迎刃而解。","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_95"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":2173,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602095,"trial_step":95},{"step":95,"content":"<color=#7683a2><i>不知何时，这已经成为了剧团的生存方式。</i></color>","style":3,"background":2173,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602096,"trial_step":96},{"step":96,"content":"<color=#7683a2><i>生活奢靡、欠债赌博、人心涣散……剧团早就没人在乎表演，大家挥霍着金钱与时光，因为无论如何都最后问题都会迎刃而解。</i></color>","style":3,"background":2173,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602097,"trial_step":97},{"step":97,"content":"<color=#7683a2><i>所有人都在等待她，所有人都在期待她。只要有她在，剧院的美梦就永远不会被戳破——</i></color>","style":3,"background":2173,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602098,"trial_step":98},{"step":98,"speaker":"珀尔夫人","content":"当年这座剧场也算是个烫手山芋，我可是花了好大力气才让这个亏钱买卖由亏转盈……","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_99"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":2173,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602099,"trial_step":99},{"step":99,"content":"不知何时，珀尔夫人已经站到你身后。她的手指轻轻贴上你的侧脸，表情被宽檐帽遮住，晦暗不明。","style":3,"background":2173,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602100,"trial_step":100},{"step":100,"speaker":"珀尔夫人","content":"美好的福尔图娜，快乐的福尔图娜……打破这片美梦的罪人是谁？","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_101"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":2173,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602101,"trial_step":101},{"step":101,"speaker":"珀尔夫人","content":"聪明的${PlayerName}，你猜到答案了吗？","voice":["vo_trial_40602_1_102"],"voice_bank":"vo_pearl_trial","style":1,"background":2173,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602102,"trial_step":102},{"step":102,"options":["……当然"],"style":6,"background":2173,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602103,"trial_step":103,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"……当然","goto":104}]},{"step":103,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"剧团里的所有人，都是同罪。","style":2,"background":2173,"log_type":1,"src_id":140602104,"trial_step":104}]}